{"articleNo":"83813","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=83813&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013-1 외국인 유학생 새마을교육 실시 참여","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.05.27","hit":"3535","attachments":[{"name":"문안(Application Form).docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=83813&attachNo=71669"},{"name":"2013-1외국인유학생 새마을교육 안내문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=83813&attachNo=71789"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>2013-1 외국인 유학생 새마을교육 실시 참여 </strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가. 일&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 시: 2013. 6. 21(금)12:00 ~22(토) 13:00 1박 2일 합숙</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">나. 장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소: 경기도 성남시 분당구 율동 새마을로 257 새마을 연수원</span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">다. 내&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 용: 1)한국의 발전상과 새마을의 역활 및 적용방안 모색 </span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2)각국문화 Festival</span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">라. 참가방법 : 한국에서 유학생 신분의 학생이면 누구나 가능</span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;참가신청서 작성 및 학생증, 여권사본(scanned)</span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"mailto:%E2%86%92globalsmu@naver.com\">→globalsmu@naver.com</a> 으로 제출</span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 참가비는 전액무료이며, 행사 후 왕복차비 지급</span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;전년도 참가자는 참가가 제한됨</span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">전화 : 02-2600-3685,3643&nbsp;&nbsp; 전송 : 031-780-7839</span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※붙임 : 외국인유학생 공고문, 참가신청서</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
